<title>UK: Prodi says Chirac lira remark &quot;misunderstanding&quot;.</title>
<headline>Prodi says Chirac lira remark &quot;misunderstanding&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Prime Minister Italian Prime Minister Romano Prodi said on Wednesday that French President Jacques Chirac had told him remarks about the lira's chance of qualifying for EMU were a &quot;misunderstanding&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;President Chirac told me yesterday night that it was a misunderstanding as often happens when you are in a debate in front of angry producers,&quot; Prodi told BBC radio.</p>
<p>Chirac's comments on Tuesday, apparently casting doubt on Italy's chances of joining the first wave of countries joining EMU, caused a storm between the two countries.</p>
</text>
